WEBVTT

00:10:59.833 --> 00:11:01.845
So ... (Laughter)

00:11:01.845 --> 00:11:06.236
So I take it into the start position, and then

00:11:06.236 --> 00:11:09.848
I press the read button. (Beeps)

00:11:09.848 --> 00:11:15.329
So it's taking a little reading from you. (Beeps)

00:11:15.329 --> 00:11:18.107
And then the pointer goes and points to three different options.

00:11:18.107 --> 00:11:21.382
Let's see what happens here.

00:11:21.382 --> 00:11:23.465
(Beeps) Oh Bruno, you can go home, actually.

00:11:23.465 --> 00:11:27.301
BG: Great. Good news. (Applause)

00:11:27.301 --> 00:11:29.646
VV: So ... (Applause)

00:11:29.646 --> 00:11:32.863
So the thing about this is that